  ('german-shepherd', 'German Shepherd', 'common', 1, 'German Shepherds are versatile working dogs commonly used in police, military, and rescue roles. They are protective, highly trainable, and thrive with structure and activity.', 'Germany', 'Loyal, Courageous, Intelligent', 'Large', '9–13 years', 'breed-reference/german-shepherd.jpg'),
  ('border-collie', 'Border Collie', 'common', 1, 'Border Collies are highly intelligent working dogs that excel in agility, obedience, and problem solving. They require lots of mental stimulation and physical exercise.', 'United Kingdom', 'Energetic, Focused, Responsive', 'Medium', '12–15 years', 'breed-reference/border-collie.jpg'),
  ('staffordshire-bull-terrier', 'Staffordshire Bull Terrier', 'common', 1, 'Staffies are muscular and confident dogs that are deeply loyal to their families. Despite their tough appearance, they are often gentle and playful companions.', 'England', 'Brave, Affectionate, Energetic', 'Medium', '12–14 years', 'breed-reference/staffordshire-bull-terrier.jpg'),
  ('groodle', 'Groodle', 'common', 1, 'Groodles combine the intelligence of the Poodle with the friendliness of the Golden Retriever. They are popular family dogs that enjoy activity and companionship.', 'Australia', 'Social, Intelligent, Gentle', 'Large', '10–15 years', 'breed-reference/groodle.jpg'),
  ('miniature-dachshund', 'Miniature Dachshund', 'common', 1, 'Miniature Dachshunds were originally bred to hunt badgers underground. They are lively little dogs with big personalities and strong loyalty to their owners.', 'Germany', 'Bold, Curious, Clever', 'Small', '12–16 years', 'breed-reference/miniature-dachshund.jpg'),
  ('cavalier-king-charles-spaniel', 'Cavalier King Charles Spaniel', 'common', 1, 'Cavaliers are loving companion dogs that enjoy cuddling and human attention. They are adaptable pets suited to both active and relaxed households.', 'United Kingdom', 'Gentle, Affectionate, Adaptable', 'Small', '10–14 years', 'breed-reference/cavalier-king-charles-spaniel.jpg'),
  ('labradoodle', 'Labradoodle', 'common', 1, 'Labradoodles combine Labrador friendliness with Poodle intelligence. They are energetic family dogs that enjoy activity and close companionship.', 'Australia', 'Outgoing, Intelligent, Social', 'Medium–Large', '12–14 years', 'breed-reference/labradoodle.jpg'),
  ('poodle-miniature', 'Poodle (Miniature)', 'common', 1, 'Miniature Poodles are energetic dogs with excellent trainability and low-shedding coats. They thrive on mental stimulation and human interaction.', 'France', 'Smart, Alert, Active', 'Small', '12–15 years', 'breed-reference/poodle-miniature.jpg'),
