  ('australian-cattle-dog', 'Australian Cattle Dog', 'uncommon', 3, 'Australian Cattle Dogs are highly driven working dogs bred to herd livestock across long distances. They are intelligent, resilient, and thrive with active owners.', 'Australia', 'Loyal, Energetic, Alert', 'Medium', '12–16 years', 'breed-reference/australian-cattle-dog.jpg'),
