  ('pomeranian', 'Pomeranian', 'uncommon', 3, 'Pomeranians are energetic toy dogs with thick fluffy coats and confident attitudes. Despite their small size, they are alert and expressive companions.', 'Germany / Poland', 'Bold, Lively, Intelligent', 'Tiny', '12–16 years', 'breed-reference/pomeranian.jpg'),
