  ('basset-hound', 'Basset Hound', 'rare', 7, 'Basset Hounds are scent-tracking dogs with incredible noses and laid-back personalities. They are affectionate companions that enjoy following scents wherever they lead.', 'France', 'Gentle, Relaxed, Stubborn', 'Medium', '10–12 years', 'breed-reference/basset-hound.jpg'),
